WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.500
Lay the paper on a flat surface.

00:07.500 --> 00:15.000
Bring both top corners to the centre line.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.500
Press along the middle to set the crease.

00:24.500 --> 00:31.500
Pull the two sides apart and flatten.

00:32.500 --> 00:39.500
Compare yours with the picture.
